{"about_the_game":"<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2847740/extras/241224_feature_1_en.gif?t=1744807651\" /><br>You have been deprived of most of your control methods. What happened? Try to understand the world when you can only slide the mouse. But if you click the mouse, unexpected and dangerous things will happen.<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2847740/extras/241224_feature_2_en.gif?t=1744807651\" /><br>Who created this world? Keep exploring more areas. There are various hidden mechanisms around the world waiting for you to crack.<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2847740/extras/241224_feature_3_en.gif?t=1744807651\" /><br>You can get different small props in the treasure chest, let them help you. After the battle upgrade, cultivate your character in each round by adding attribute points.<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2847740/extras/241224_feature_4_en.gif?t=1744807651\" /><br>Partners went on an adventure together, but were accidentally teleported to different places. Where are they? What happened? Everything is waiting for your exploration!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">About the Developer</h2>From the developer of Bubble People, using the same jittery hand-drawn style and adding more color! This is my 8th game on Steam.","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2847740?t=1744807651","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2847740?t=1744807651","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2847740/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744807651","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2847740/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1744807651","categories":[{"descriptio